<view class="page {{reducedMotion ? 'reduced' : ''}} {{reducedTransparency ? 'solid' : ''}}"><view class="content trade-wrap"><view class="trade-head"><view class="section-caption">校园回声 / 私有交易信息</view><view class="trade-title">{{setup ? '卖家收款信息' : '付款材料与核对'}}</view></view><view class="notice warning">付费资料须遵循微信虚拟支付规则，当前付费和新收款信息配置未开放。既有订单保留必要材料与售后访问。</view><campus-state wx:if="{{loading}}" kind="loading" title="正在核对访问权限"/><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error" aria-role="alert">{{error}}</view>
<view wx:if="{{setup && !paidEnabled}}" class="trade-panel"><view class="section-title">收款信息配置未开放</view></view><view wx:elif="{{setup}}" class="trade-panel"><view class="trade-value">{{configured ? '已配置私有收款信息' : '尚未配置收款信息'}}</view><view class="trade-note">仅对应订单买家可查看收款码，不会出现在资料广场或公开资料详情。变更不影响旧订单锁定的收款信息。</view><button class="secondary full" bindtap="choose" loading="{{busy === 'image'}}" disabled="{{!!busy}}">{{assetId ? '重新选择收款码' : '选择私有收款码'}}</button><view wx:if="{{assetId}}" class="notice">图片已上传，点击保存后生效。</view><button class="primary full" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy === 'submit'}}" disabled="{{!!busy || !assetId}}">保存收款信息</button></view>
<block wx:elif="{{order}}"><view class="trade-panel"><view class="trade-status">{{order.statusLabel}}</view><view class="trade-title">{{order.title}}</view><view class="trade-price">{{order.displayPrice}}</view><view class="trade-note">订单 {{order.shortId}} · 金额及文件版本已锁定</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{order.viewerRole === 'buyer' && !order.free && order.status === 'awaitingPayment'}}" class="trade-panel"><button class="secondary full" bindtap="qr" disabled="{{!!busy}}">查看本订单私有收款码</button><image wx:if="{{qrUrl}}" class="trade-qr" src="{{qrUrl}}" mode="aspectFit" binderror="imageError" aria-label="本订单卖家收款码"/><view class="trade-note">当前付费关闭，不要发起新转账。若已有真实付款材料，可保留记录并申请协调。</view><button class="secondary full" bindtap="choose" loading="{{busy === 'image'}}" disabled="{{!!busy}}">{{assetId ? '重新选择凭证' : '上传付款凭证'}}</button><view wx:if="{{assetId}}" class="notice">凭证图片已上传，尚未提交。</view><label class="trade-label" for="transfer-ref">转账单号（2–80字）</label><input id="transfer-ref" class="trade-input" value="{{transferReference}}" data-key="transferReference" bindinput="input" maxlength="-1"/><label class="trade-label" for="proof-note">补充说明（选填2–200字）</label><textarea id="proof-note" class="trade-textarea" value="{{note}}" data-key="note" bindinput="input" maxlength="-1" adjust-position="{{true}}" cursor-spacing="24"/><button class="primary full" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy === 'submit'}}" disabled="{{!!busy}}">提交材料，等待卖家核对</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{order.status === 'awaitingSeller' || order.status === 'deliverable' || order.status === 'completed'}}" class="trade-panel"><button class="secondary full" bindtap="proof" disabled="{{!!busy}}">申请查看私有凭证</button><image wx:if="{{proofUrl}}" class="trade-qr" src="{{proofUrl}}" mode="aspectFit" binderror="imageError" aria-label="买家提交的付款材料"/><view wx:if="{{proofUrl}}" class="trade-value">单号：{{proofReference}}
{{proofNote}}</view><view class="trade-note">请在收款账户核对到账。</view><button wx:if="{{order.viewerRole === 'seller' && order.status === 'awaitingSeller'}}" class="primary full" bindtap="receipt" loading="{{busy === 'receipt'}}" disabled="{{!!busy}}">卖家本人核对到账并开放文件</button></view><view wx:if="{{localDraftRetained && order.status !== 'awaitingPayment'}}" class="trade-panel"><view class="section-title">本机未提交说明</view><view class="trade-note">以下内容写于上次提交之后，仅保留在本机。可复制到订单留言补充，不代表已提交付款材料。</view><label class="trade-label" for="retained-transfer-ref">后续转账单号</label><input id="retained-transfer-ref" class="trade-input" value="{{transferReference}}" data-key="transferReference" bindinput="input" maxlength="-1" aria-label="后续转账单号，本机未提交"/><label class="trade-label" for="retained-proof-note">后续补充说明</label><textarea id="retained-proof-note" class="trade-textarea" value="{{note}}" data-key="note" bindinput="input" maxlength="-1" adjust-position="{{true}}" cursor-spacing="24" aria-label="后续补充说明，本机未提交"/></view></block></view></view>